-text-paragraph-2 gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; text-align: inherit!important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;">Shilajit von Wellness Nest wird mit der alten Methode „SURYA TAPI“ gereinigt.</p><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; text-align: inherit!important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: inherit !important;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Was ist </span><strong>SURYA TAPI</strong>?</p><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; text-align: inherit!important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: inherit !important;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">SURYA TAPI bedeutet </span><strong>sonnengetrocknet</strong>.</p><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; text-align: inherit!important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Poppins; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: inherit !important;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Es ist die natürlichste </span><strong>Methode zur Reinigung von Shilajit</strong> und auch die beste Art, die Wirksamkeit, Mineralien und Vitamine von Shilajit zu bewahren.</p><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="3" data-key="content" class="plus iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717039660993" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717039660993"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">Kann ich es einfach essen? Schmeckt es schlecht?</div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:#1890FF"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#1890FF"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="3" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717039661111" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717039661111"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf_gs-text-paragraph-2" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">Es hat einen starken, natürlich erdigen Geschmack und wir empfehlen Ihnen, es mit warmem Wasser oder anderen Flüssigkeiten wie warmer Milch zu mischen.</div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="4" data-key="content" class="plus iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717039661113" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717039661113"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">Wie viel Shilajit-Harz sollte ich pro Tag zu mir nehmen?</div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:#1890FF"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#1890FF"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="4" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717039660986" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717039660986"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf_gs-text-paragraph-2" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">Sie brauchen nur 1 erbsengroße Menge einmal oder zweimal am Tag, damit unser Shilajit wirksam ist. Normalerweise dauert es 2 Wochen bis 3 Monate, bis größere Veränderungen eintreten (je nach Person).<div></div><div></div></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="5" data-key="content" class="plus iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717042644514" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717042644514"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">Ist Shilajit Essential Extract sicher? Kann Shilajit mit Medikamenten oder bestehenden Erkrankungen interagieren?</div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="border-icon" style="border-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="5" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1717042644464" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1717042644464"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-2" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><div>Bei richtiger Anwendung gilt Shilajit für die meisten Menschen als sicher. Es ist jedoch wichtig, es verantwortungsbewusst zu verwenden und vorher einen Arzt zu konsultieren, insbesondere wenn Sie an einer Krankheit leiden oder Medikamente einnehmen. Shilajit kann mit Blutdruck-, Diabetes- oder blutverdünnenden Medikamenten interagieren. Menschen mit Erkrankungen wie Nierenerkrankungen sollten vorsichtig sein. Besprechen Sie mögliche Wechselwirkungen immer mit Ihrem Arzt, um die Sicherheit basierend auf Ihrem Gesundheits- und Medikamentenplan zu gewährleisten.</div><div><div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1722831447924" class="element-wrap gf_gs-spacing-xs-m-top" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1722831447924" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:40,&quot;y&quot;:8207,&quot;w&quot;:400,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:299,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8267}" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-stretch-lg="0" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:40,&quot;y&quot;:8207,&quot;w&quot;:400,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:299,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8267}" data-stretch-xs="0"><a class="button btn gf_button gf_gs-spacing-xs-p-left gf_gs-spacing-xs-p-right gf_gs-spacing-sm-p-bottom gf_gs-spacing-sm-p-top gf_gs-button-element gf_gs-button---large" href="#m-1717055659322" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc="" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:112,&quot;y&quot;:8207,&quot;w&quot;:254,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:371,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8267}" data-scroll-speed-xs="2000"><span bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:120,&quot;y&quot;:8232,&quot;w&quot;:238,&quot;h&quot;:19,&quot;abs_x&quot;:379,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8292}">►  SHILAJIT RISIKOFREI TESTEN</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1722829183208" class="element-wrap gf_gs-spacing-xs-m-top" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1722829183208" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:8292,&quot;w&quot;:464,&quot;h&quot;:42,&quot;